WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,720
Mom, I plan to go to sea tonight

2
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:21,900
Eat first, then go after eating

3
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:28,440
There are many more ships

4
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:37,160
But they are not from our village

5
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,160
Isn’t this my junior high school classmate Ma San?

6
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,160
We had a pretty good relationship back then

7
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,160
I remember he also became a fisherman after graduation

8
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:44,160
But they have their own wharf in Majia Village

9
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:47,160
Why did he risk his life and come to Houhai Village?

10
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:49,510
Brother Ma, why did you come to our village pier?

11
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:53,300
I’ve seen you but I still don’t know

12
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,300
There are people in your village who go to sea

13
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,300
It covered hundreds of kilograms of black eagles and more than two hundred kilograms of sea eagles.

14
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:00,300
The news spread throughout several nearby fishing villages
